      "label": "Stereotype of humans sharing food or affection with animals",
      "description": "The trope of humans feeding or affectionately interacting with animals (e.g., goats, dogs, cats) is common in media and advertising, often used to evoke feelings of warmth, innocence, or wholesome behavior. This meme plays on that trope to create a humorous juxtaposition with the phrase 'sharing and caring'.",
