      "label": "The use of irony in memes to mock or parody social norms",
      "description": "Memes often use irony by placing an image or scenario in contrast with a phrase or concept to create humor or critique. Here, the image of a man sharing a snack with a goat is juxtaposed with the phrase 'sharing and caring' to mock the idea of human social responsibility or to highlight the absurdity of applying human social norms to animals.",
