      "description": "The user is projected onto the scene depicting the man sharing a snack with the goat, as this is the central visual material that the meme uses to create its ironic juxtaposition with the text 'sharing and caring'. The user is invited to imagine themselves in the role of the man or to identify with the affectionate, humorous interaction being portrayed.",
